+// same production constructors the trained stack CLI uses (`TrainedExport`,
+// with `--dd`'s `Geometry::dd`; `IoSpec::new_shaped`, `prepare_endpoints`,
+// `RunStatement::new_bound`, `run::prove_run`) or, at the DD development
+// rung, the native lane's own R9 test recipe (`r9_tests.rs`: the trained-band
